  "description": "Start your BMX journey the right way with the Revo line. Built to deliver an authentic freestyle riding experience, the Revo combines durability, performance, and incredible value in one complete package. Every component has been carefully selected to ensure the bike is ready to shred straight out of the box, easy to maintain, and upgradeable as your skills progress. Loaded with features like tapered fork legs, and short, responsive pro-inspired geometry, the Revo is designed to help riders progress faster and have more fun doing it.\nA rider never forgets their first BMX bike, which is why we made sure the Revo 14\" was built to be the perfect start. Comfortable and easy to ride thanks to its railed seat and dependable V-brake, it's also designed for progression. Lightweight tubing keeps the bike agile and manageable, giving young shredders the confidence to hit the skatepark, learn to pump, and discover their love for BMX.\n\nBRAKE: RADIO \"AM\" caliper brake, alloy, front / RADIO \"AM-V\" v-brake, alloy, rear",
